ate v2/frontend/public/paper_edge_recovery/latest/operator_dashboard_payload.json and claude_worklog/final_readiness/paper_edge_recovery/latest/operator_dashboard_payload.json with cumulative PnL, pre-filter PnL, post-filter PnL, post-filter fills, post-filter unsafe fills, edge status, no-trade status, threshold replay best safe profile, blocked intent counts, shadow observations pending, trainer source coverage, feature freshness coverage, edge-after-costs coverage, remaining blockers, live_gate, and live_symbols.  Validation required: py_compile, unit/integration tests, JSON validation, frontend build/typecheck/sync when affected, secret scan, forbidden-action scan, final approval token absent, Redis trim approval absent, old Redis write absence, exchange action absence. Do not mark positive edge proven unless post-filter fills exist and produce positive net after fees/slippage.  Output required files exactly: BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_readiness/paper_edge_recovery/latest/GO_NO_GO.md V2_PAPER_EDGE_RECOVERY_BLOCKED END_FILE  BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_readiness/paper_edge_recovery/latest/V2_PAPER_EDGE_RECOVERY_AND_COST_AWARE_TRADE_SELECTION_REPORT.md ...implementation report, evidence, tests, safety status, and honest remaining blockers... END_FILE  BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_readiness/paper_edge_recovery/latest/paper_edge_recovery_status.json {\"task_id\":\"claude_v2_paper_edge_recovery_and_cost_aware_trade_selection\",\"live_gate\":\"blocked_human_only\",\"live_symbols\":[],\"approves_live\":false,\"approves_legacy_shutdown\":false} END_FILE  BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_readiness/paper_edge_recovery/latest/PAPER_EDGE_THRESHOLD_REPLAY_REPORT.md ...threshold replay report... END_FILE  BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_readiness/paper_edge_recovery/latest/paper_edge_threshold_replay.json {\"task_id\":\"paper_edge_threshold_replay\",\"classification\":\"NO_TRADE_EDGE_NOT_FOUND_OR_PROFILE_READY\"} END_FILE  BEGIN_FILE: claude_worklog/final_read